+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; worker-src 'none'; manifest-src 'none'">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container privacy-notice">
+    <h1>Your privacy at The Daily Grind</h1>
+    <p>This notice covers the static pages delivered by this website.</p>
+    <h2>Browse without tracking</h2>
+    <p>These pages use no analytics, advertising trackers, cookies, browser storage, or client-side scripts. They do not request your location, camera, microphone, or other device permissions. There are no forms collecting personal information.</p>
+    <h2>Images and other resources</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served by this website. Viewing these pages does not load fonts, embeds, or other resources from third-party websites. The coffee photograph was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally.</p>
+    <h2>Website delivery</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends connection information, such as your IP address and requested page, to the service delivering this website. That service may keep access or security logs. Hosting log settings and retention are controlled by the website operator and cannot be determined from these pages.</p>
+    <h2>Account and ordering services</h2>
+    <p>This static website does not implement accounts, rewards, ordering, or payments. Any service added for those features will need its own information about what data it collects, why it needs it, how long it keeps it, and how you can request deletion before you submit information.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer>
+    <p><a href="/">The Daily Grind</a> &middot; Privacy</p>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+</html>
